<title>MALTA: SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND, FIRST LEG RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND, FIRST LEG RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spartak Trnava (Slovakia) beat Birkirkara (Malta) 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a UEFA Cup first preliminary round, first leg match at the Ta'Qali stadium on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Dusan Tittel 14</p>
<p>Red cards: Jeffrey Farrugia (Birkirkara), Vladimir Leitner (Spartak)</p>
